[I] Fast header-only C++ unit testing

[T] doctest is a single-header C++ testing framework that is light on
[T] compile times and runtime overhead. Tests can be written directly next
[T] to production code and stripped out with a define, making it suitable
[T] for embedding tests in libraries.

[U] https://github.com/doctest/doctest

[A] Doctest Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS

[V] 2.5.3
[L] MIT
[P] X -----5---9 700.000

[D] 50bf8c459951375afb4f563ed2a9cff15c846446f22260b4a5416b84 doctest-2.5.3.tar.gz https://github.com/doctest/doctest/archive/refs/tags/v2.5.3/

runmeson=0
var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DDOCTEST_WITH_TESTS=OFF
